  "94087234-1252-4fac-8a47-76cfad7d1124"],
 " are the same with the midpoint given as a token."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"23730e48-78aa-4d69-bc32-d4d909fb7346"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The midpoints are the vertices ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " of the interval ",
 StyleBox["I(p, q)", "TI"],
 " that minimize ",
 StyleBox["max(d(p, v), d(v, q))", "TI"],
 ". For ",
 StyleBox["d(p, q) = 2k", "TI"],
 " they are the vertices with ",
 StyleBox["d(p, v) = d(v, q) = k", "TI"],
 ". For ",
 StyleBox["d(p, q) = 2k + 1", "TI"],
 " they are the two middle layers, at distances ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["k + 1", "TI"],
 " from ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"fbbef244-a056-4251-94d1-6658e71cd722"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A midpoint need not be unique. On the square grid, with ",
 StyleBox["a \[LessEqual] b", "TI"],
 " the axis steps from ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 ", there are ",
 StyleBox["a + 1", "TI"],
 " midpoints when ",
 StyleBox["a + b", "TI"],
 " is even and ",
 StyleBox["2(a + 1)", "TI"],
 " when it is odd."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"0a6499bb-33c1-496a-8369-9e3884adcadf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Equal points give the point itself. Points in different components give ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b829ab23-c739-4f1b-bf02-a4c3c02bb613"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"06b13587-7a31-4628-91a8-2449c02fe623"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The draw is uniform over the midpoints. The count ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 " can be ",
 Cell[BoxData["n"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8cb511c3-f2ae-4daa-af16-85a70bc817c3"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"UpTo", "[", "n", "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "860cd362-0386-4930-98af-610daadcb833"],
 " or ",
 Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f3e0562a-7753-4e8b-a5a9-a7b279b8aa6b"],
 "; ",
 Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "eca0e24a-7bc8-4d45-bd2b-5961d165bfa7"],
 " gives them in vertex order."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"098ffaca-8107-4b70-a2a2-806bda5dffba"],

