Cell["\<\
At odd distance there are two middle layers. The segment of length 5 with \
axis steps 2 and 3 has 6 midpoints:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"c1d0b211-51f3-4a33-9eb5-4f1b4b13eb6c"],

